      "id": "L0-S1-01",
      "layer": "L0",
      "scenario": "S1_fix_bug",
      "title": "修复分块函数：末块被截断且未拒绝非法 size",
      "input": {
        "prompt": "修复 chunk(items, size)：最后一块被少取一个元素；size<=0 时应当拒绝而不是静默返回错结果。",
        "artifact": {
          "code": "def chunk(items, size):\n    out = []\n    for i in range(0, len(items), size):\n        out.append(items[i:i + size - 1])\n    return out\n"
        },
        "contract": "保持函数名与位置参数不变；只返回分块列表；不引入新依赖"
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "checker": "python_probes",
          "path": "code",
          "args": {
            "probes": [
              {
                "call": "chunk",
                "args": [
                  [
                    1,
                    2,
                    3,
                    4,
                    5
                  ],
                  2
                ],
                "expected": [
                  [
                    1,
                    2
                  ],
                  [
                    3,
                    4
                  ],
                  [
                    5
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "call": "chunk",
                "args": [
                  [],
                  2
                ],
                "expected": []
              },
              {
                "call": "chunk",
                "args": [
                  [
                    1
                  ],
                  3
                ],
                "expected": [
                  [
                    1
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "call": "chunk",
                "args": [
                  [
                    7,
                    8,
                    9
                  ],
                  3
                ],
                "expected": [
                  [
                    7,
                    8,
                    9
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "call": "chunk",
                "args": [
                  [
                    1,
                    2
                  ],
                  0
                ],
                "raises": "ValueError"
              }
            ]
          },
          "why": "机械判定：修好后的函数在 5 组边界输入（含空输入、整除、非整除、非法 size）上的返回值/异常必须逐项相等"
        }
      ],
      "verdict_kind": "mechanical",
      "notes": "负例探针 = size<=0 必须抛 ValueError；空白输入与整除边界各一条"
    },
    {
      "id": "L0-S1-02",
      "layer": "L0",
      "scenario": "S1_fix_bug",
      "title": "修复除零被静默吞掉的安全除法",
      "input": {
        "prompt": "safe_div(a, b) 在 b==0 时静默返回 0，掩盖了调用方的错误；应改为显式报错。",
        "artifact": {
          "code": "def safe_div(a, b):\n    try:\n        return a / b\n    except ZeroDivisionError:\n        return 0\n"
        },
        "contract": "保持函数名与位置参数不变；b==0 抛 ValueError"
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "checker": "python_probes",
          "path": "code",
          "args": {
            "probes": [
              {
                "call": "safe_div",
                "args": [
                  6,
                  3
                ],
                "expected": 2.0
              },
              {
                "call": "safe_div",
                "args": [
                  10,
                  4
                ],
                "expected": 2.5
              },
              {
                "call": "safe_div",
                "args": [
                  0,
                  5
                ],
                "expected": 0.0
              },
              {
                "call": "safe_div",
                "args": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "raises": "ValueError"
              }
            ]
          },
          "why": "机械判定：正常/负被除数/零被除数/除零四组输入的返回值与异常逐项相等（静默返回 0 会在第 4 条探针失败）"
        }
      ],
      "verdict_kind": "mechanical",
      "notes": "该条锚直接对齐 v7.2「不可追溯的数字比没有数字更危险」：静默吞异常必须被判负"
    },
